        "memory_tip": "Her father gave her his only X, and his X was the faulty one.",
        "margin_note": "Reason it out in words before writing any genotype.",
        "lines": [
          "The woman's father is colour blind, so the",
          "X chromosome she gets from him carries the",
          "recessive gene.",
          "Her mother is homozygous for normal vision,",
          "so the X she gets from her mother is normal.",
          "So the woman has normal vision but is a",
          "carrier."
